{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_14", "source_id": "67f782d2000000001d02c40d", "title": "去闭口真的很简单", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67f782d2000000001d02c40d", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1112, "evidence_unit_count": 29, "original_evidence_unit_count": 29, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["我长了10年闭口，曾经以为脸就这样了，反反复复，长了就消，消了又长", "那可以试试我超爱的科颜氏溜溜瓶，我用下来发现它很温和，但效果却很惊艳", "所以去闭口对它来说简直是小菜一碟，坚持用的话，皮肤会变得越来越细腻，就连毛孔都没那么明显了", "KIEHL'S ADVANCED DERM SOLUTIONS", "zing 吸收后皮肤0负担 完卡不粘腻~而且早晚可用 1", "我习惯在洗完脸后第一步直接用它，先全脸打底一遍，在脸上有粗糙长闭口的区域再重点叠加打圈按摩吸收", "一般在三五天内就能消失得干干净净，但针清再好也只能治标，只要过段时间，又会陷入到闭口反复的恶性循环中，所以想要彻底改善的话，我觉得你们可以试试用下酸类产品"], "retained_quotes": ["我习惯在洗完脸后第一步直接用它，先全脸打底一遍，在脸上有粗糙长闭口的区域再重点叠加打圈按摩吸收", "一般在三五天内就能消失得干干净净，但针清再好也只能治标，只要过段时间，又会陷入到闭口反复的恶性循环中，所以想要彻底改善的话，我觉得你们可以试试用下酸类产品"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67f782d2000000001d02c40d/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67f782d2000000001d02c40d/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67f782d2000000001d02c40d/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67f782d2000000001d02c40d/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "04f5441c6c2697e4e430a473421050e539b138e6f505dd3331a3dd60ce571efd", "card_hash": "52990ca35b7756bd88ca5542149ad134d29cee7ba4a4891e5b96c